# Belligerent of the Ball: "if two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield under your control this turn" (CR 603.4).
# Black Lotus enters on turn 1 (not on turn 3, so it does not count then). On turn 3 Bot1 plays a Mountain (a land, not counted) and casts the
# Belligerent with the Lotus: only one nonland permanent entered, so no trigger and no target prompt at the beginning of combat.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Mountain
Belligerent of the Ball
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Belligerent of the Ball.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Belligerent of the Ball.Power = 3

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Belligerent of the Ball.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Belligerent of the Ball.Keywords = (absent)
